# Route: guide 30 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren
# (1211 of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 52 to
# 53, 5 quests, 0.6 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Burning Steppes): Ruins of Thaurissan -> Blackrock Stronghold -> Ruins
# of Thaurissan -> Blackrock Mountain.
